// Mercy Island


// HISTORY

// Eldritch War

"CoTHistory1" "It is said that the snake-like beings that live in the rotting warrens of this island were cast-offs of the 'Children of Enos', a bizarre cult that settled these islands in the 1600s. Rumors persist that the original snake-beings who sired the creatures visible today are still alive, writhing somewhere within their labyrinthine lairs."

// TOURISM

// Cesspool
"Mercy1" "Many would-be villains have drunk their fill from the cesspool in hopes that it might grant super power. Mostly they go insane."

// Snake Charmer
"Mercy2" "This is the main entrance to the Snake's underground lair.  You really don't want to go down there."

// Chum
"Mercy3" "Just when you thought it was safe."

// Fortified
"Mercy4" "Arachnos built the wall around Mercy to keep it safe."

// Movin' On Up
"Mercy5" "This is the good life. The higher up you get, the bigger you are."

// Widower
"Mercy6" "They say that lonely tower is the home of Ghost Widow, Lord Recluse's phantom servant."
